    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDistinguished by it's attractive stone and brick façade, 8 Deerpark Manor is a superbly presented four-bedroom family home extending to 132 sq.m. approx. nestled within the highly sought-after Deerpark Manor development.\n\n\nDesigned with modern family living in mind, the accommodation is both practical and versatile. The ground floor comprises an entrance hall, a comfortable sitting room, an open-plan kitchen/dining room, a sunroom overlooking the rear garden, utility room, guest W.C., and a generously sized ground floor bedroom with ensuite, making it an ideal space for guests or a home office. Upstairs, the property offers three double bedrooms, including a superb master bedroom with ensuite, together with a well-appointed family bathroom.\n\n\nExternally, a generous cobblelock driveway to the front provides ample off-street parking, while the large, private rear south facing garden and patio offers a peaceful and secluded outdoor retreat.\n\n\nLocated just 1km from Virginia town centre, the property is within easy reach of schools, shops, cafés, restaurants, and a host of local amenities. The scenic Lough Ramor and the N3/M3 road network are also nearby, offering excellent recreational opportunities and convenient access to Navan and Dublin.\n\n\nThis is an ideal opportunity for families, first-time buyers, or anyone seeking a spacious home in a convenient and desirable setting.\n\n\nViewing is highly recommeded by the sole selling agents."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - \nPolish tiled flooring, recessed lighting.\n\nSitting Room - 5.41m x 4.10m\nLaminate flooring, stove with brick surround, coving, centrepiece.\n\nKitchen Dining Room - 6.20m x 4.00m\nPolish tiled flooring, modern fitted kicthen, recessed lighting, coving.\n\nSunroom - 2.90m x 2.34m\nPolish tiled flooring, recessed lighting, sliding patio doors.\n\nUtility Room - 2.59m x 2.36m\nPolish tiled flooring, fitted units, door to rear.\n\nGuest w.c. - 1.37m x 1.47m\nTiled flooring, w.c., wash hand basin.\n\nGround floor bedroom - 4.23m x 2.59m\nLaminate flooring, coving.\n\nEnsuite - 2.62m x 1.06m\nTiled flooring, w.c., wash hand basin, shower, part tiled.\n\nFirst Floor - \n\n\nMaster Bedroom - 5.95m x 4.55m\nLaminate flooring, recessed lighting.\n\nEnsuite - 2.62m x 1.06m\nTiled flooring, w.c., wash hand basin, shower, part tiled.\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.45m x 2.91m\nLaminate flooring.\n\nBedroom 4 - 3.17m x 2.41m\nLaminate flooring.\n\nBathroom - 2.07m x 2.02m\n\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Well-presented and spacious accommodation.</li><li>Superb south facing aspect to the rear.</li><li>Laminate and tiled flooring throughout.</li><li>Mature private residential development. </li><li>Walking distance of Virginia town centre.</li><li>Gas central heating.</li><li>Main services.</ul>"
